---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
    title="Contatti | Poliurea System"
    description="Contatta Poliurea System per informazioni su infiltrazioni, impermeabilizzazioni e per richiedere un sopralluogo."
    activePath="/contatti"
>
    <PageIntro
        eyebrow="CONTATTI"
        title="Raccontaci"
        highlight="cosa succede."
        text="Una macchia sul soffitto, un muro umido o una copertura da verificare? Inviaci una richiesta: ci aiuterà a capire come ricontattarti."
    />
    <section class="contact-page wrap my-12 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] items-center">
        <div class="contact-panel rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700">
            <p class="eyebrow text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400 mb-2">IL MODO PIÙ SEMPLICE PER INIZIARE</p>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">Descrivici il tuo<br /><span class="text-sky-400">problema.</span></h2>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">Il modulo guidato raccoglie le informazioni essenziali, ti permette di aggiungere foto e invia la richiesta al nostro team.</p>
            <a class="button button-primary inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-sky-500 hover:bg-sky-400 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-sky-500/25 transition-colors duration-300 hover:shadow-sky-500/40 hover:-translate-y-0.5 w-full" href="/preventivo">Compila il modulo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <div class="contact-assurance mt-8 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-400"><span class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sky-500/15 text-sky-400 text-xs font-bold">✓</span> Consulenza gratuita e senza impegno</div>
        </div>
        <aside class="contact-details rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/60 p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700">
            <p class="eyebrow text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400 mb-2">RECAPITI AZIENDALI</p>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">I canali diretti<br />per il tuo intervento.</h2>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Siamo operativi per sopralluoghi tecnici e consulenze su misura. Per una risposta rapida e una presa in carico ordinata, compila il modulo o contattaci ai recapiti dedicati.</p>
            <div class="contact-placeholder flex items-start sm:items-center gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-3.5 sm:p-4 mb-3 shadow-inner transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-900/90">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/25 text-sky-400 text-lg">☎</span>
                <div class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm">
                    <small class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400">TELEFONO DIRETTO</small>
                    <a href="tel:+390282956740" class="text-white font-semibold hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors break-words">+39 02 8295 6740</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-placeholder flex items-start sm:items-center gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-3.5 sm:p-4 mb-3 shadow-inner transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-900/90">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/25 text-sky-400 text-lg">✉</span>
                <div class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm">
                    <small class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400">EMAIL INFORMAZIONI</small>
                    <a href="mailto:info@poliureasystem.it" class="text-white font-semibold hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors break-words">info@poliureasystem.it</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-placeholder flex items-start sm:items-center gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-3.5 sm:p-4 mb-3 shadow-inner transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-900/90">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/25 text-sky-400 text-lg">⌖</span>
                <div class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm">
                    <small class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400">SEDE OPERATIVA / AREA SERVITA</small>
                    <strong class="text-white font-semibold block break-words">Milano e interventi in tutta Italia</strong>
                </div>
            </div>
        </aside>
    </section>
    <section class="contact-bottom py-14 bg-zinc-950 border-y border-zinc-800">
        <div class="wrap contact-bottom-inner flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-6">
            <div><p class="eyebrow text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400 mb-1">HAI GIÀ RACCOLTO I DETTAGLI?</p><h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white">Il sopralluogo si prepara<br />con le <span class="text-sky-400">informazioni giuste.</span></h2></div>
            <a class="text-link inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors" href="/metodo">Scopri il metodo <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
    </section>
</SiteLayout>
